# Everything under `.mistral/` is written by the `mistral apps` CLI: the vendored registry subtree
# (git mode), the resolved descriptors, and the selection and generation state. Collapsed in GitHub
# diffs so a capability add or bump does not bury the review.
.mistral/** linguist-generated

# Generated from the API by `bunx nx run api:gen-openapi` and `bash tools/gen-types.sh`; never edited
# by hand. Collapsed in GitHub diffs and left out of the language statistics.
apps/api/openapi.json linguist-generated
apps/web/src/api/generated/** linguist-generated

# The generated OpenWiki evidence index counts as documentation, not as code.
openwiki/** linguist-documentation
